+and the AFD attention node's chunk header). Changes in the port: the recipe's edits
+to its TP-only `forward._compute` prefetch and `split_layers` are not taken; instead the layer loop's existing
+`mixer` hook runs `kda_rows` / `dsa_rows` per piece, and `kda_block` / `_dsa_latent` call the same functions for a
+chunk of their own, so without the setting the forward's calls are the ones before; there is no prompt grid here, so
+pieces end at a stream's kept points (or its end) and cut in multiples of 64 rows; streams drafting with the MTP head
+fill alone; on the attention/expert split's attention node a multi-prompt chunk is one prompt-chunk forward of at
+most the expert nodes' `prefill_rows` rows (no wire change). `TF_GLM_MULTI_PREFILL` is off unless set (the recipe's
+`config.sh` turns it on).
